@startuml
!theme cyborg
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontColor #F3F4F6
skinparam ArrowColor #CBD5E1
skinparam shadowing false
top to bottom direction
title Low-Level Design Contract and Verification Chain
rectangle "Accepted scope / exact requirement criteria\nSelected ADRs and HLD boundaries" as source
rectangle "Owning module / use case\nActor, resource, preconditions and invariants" as owner
rectangle "Detailed contracts\nInputs, versions, request identity, results and errors" as contract
rectangle "Persistence / adapters\nLocal transaction, protected references and remote effects" as persistence
rectangle "Implementation slice\nActual code, migrations and configuration" as implementation
rectangle "Verification evidence\nNormal, denied, stale, concurrent and interrupted cases" as evidence
source --> owner
owner --> contract
contract --> persistence
persistence --> implementation
implementation --> evidence
evidence ..> contract : Diagnose gaps / refine affected design
legend bottom
  Core and ProjectForge retain independent ownership and scoped integration.
  Proposed signatures are design seams, not implemented production interfaces.
  Documentation completion does not establish runtime acceptance or authorize deployment.
endlegend
@enduml
